{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（20日）上午10時33分，荔枝角青山道688至690號嘉名工廠大廈發生火警。多人致電報警，消防員在場灌救，並於約15分鐘後將火救熄。事件中60人自行疏散，一人感到不適，需要戴上氧氣罩送往明愛醫院治理。人員經初步調查，相信是雜物起火肇禍。</p><p>現場消息指，起火位置是7至8樓，消防員架起雲梯射水撲救，並救出一人。由網上片段可見，起火是一處露天有簷篷的位置，火光熊熊，濃煙往上直冒。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防架起雲梯救火。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200405619018829824458397.jpeg/mLZrqJSthIAaWEfvwShRS0hMDcrY1TsN3wQrE_oEKxM\"/><figcaption>消防架起雲梯救火。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名男子感到不適，需要戴上氧氣罩送院治理。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200404412808302592682907.jpeg/1wCN4YzR2dG8kCyxqLKfOZLp1QHLBT-nWSiejHwonow\"/><figcaption>一名男子感到不適，需要戴上氧氣罩送院治理。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工廈單位火光熊熊，冒出濃煙。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200401672854310912298574.jpeg/rXMVQcbdS64CpQkUMLQvj9xsDRBBu9SdUPFxdlDxcXY\"/><figcaption>工廈單位火光熊熊，冒出濃煙。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工廈單位火光熊熊。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200401670740250624526431.jpeg/ZpXgeIhD_wAX-IGUTACfpI2O0Z2znbSyiEJmmIhCZpg\"/><figcaption>工廈單位火光熊熊。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工廈單位火光熊熊。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200401667825078272247689.jpeg/NC0of2dKmgqA44FPSLuVmu6MGPmzb2Gbb3uaKm97mio\"/><figcaption>工廈單位火光熊熊。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有人抱貓逃生。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200403925077856256312097.jpeg/Jj8UaX44DjtHmnhO_EwKmICUw_3p0Qh4dEDAJVFAwCU\"/><figcaption>有人抱貓逃生。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"附近居民疏散。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200403927963668480684913.jpeg/NOY7S0P9fUpmAqsbLwoAaulNTjnIO06-BDkPxiE5D8Y\"/><figcaption>附近居民疏散。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200403930740428800230967.jpeg/oqmzcMi6HOLwXcoQt81Tcr5Tnyo4dxMkSldwOW9XcDk\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200403936193286144204918.jpeg/AetYtCQUiFUi_1zLkEqwfKiOMY7tdA8ZLge49AsHuPQ\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是嘉名工廠大廈。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200405289757577216925643.jpeg/fItgCGD2J-XgqEcjyk2byNBkRQhY6XliCTsRuyw7Ebs\"/><figcaption>現場是嘉名工廠大廈。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200405293360615424431596.jpeg/hfE0Uay6P4RE8fKYGYpPDci0ws7VV6PFj804JqrNOCY\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防架起雲梯救火。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200403919319076864527163.jpeg/jZiD7Y2HjKL36GimIlr5ODm-vbR9BAVVBDWNBSE1jQU\"/><figcaption>消防架起雲梯救火。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防架起雲梯救火。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200403922636902400894031.jpeg/BKjHlGqDYpuxRXha04vKAdjkZRIlnPUz3LUM9fm1DPU\"/><figcaption>消防架起雲梯救火。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200403933299085312057968.jpeg/Hq8-TQ5w0TBe2KM0Dg-PP_LH72llFYcL651fA86dXwM\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T03:24:02.149486+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":420,"images":14,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T02:56:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T03:17:25.214655+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T03:17:25.214655+00:00","content_hash":"9911d49a6caba08a463a454b9d2bb8b67b0ddccaca316093ca90517efc18d3c7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}